    "sub_name": "華語教學實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTISE FOR TEACHING CHINESE (2)",
    "describe_ch": "透過進班觀課或小班教學的練習模式，讓學生將華語教學的方法、教學資源和第二語言習得理論、班級經營模式，應用於實際教學中。學生從做中學，紀錄教學日誌，分享教學心得，調整教學成效。",
    "describe_eh": "By class observation or microteaching, students can try Chinese teaching methods, resources, theory of Second Language Acquisition, and interaction between the student and teacher. Students learn by doing, write teaching report, share teaching experiences, and adjust teaching effectiveness.",
    "pre_subname": "",
